      "body": "Closing as a duplicate of #50617, which already fixes this and fixes it better.\n\nThat PR adds `FP8_PER_CHANNEL_PER_TOKEN` to the mixed-precision dispatch as part of a general\nscheme→config table, and its own comment names the exact failure mode — *\"FP8_PER_CHANNEL_PER_TOKEN\nand FP8_PB_WO used to fall through\"*. My two-line branch addresses the same fall-through\nnarrowly; the table is the right shape for it.\n\nMy duplicate check before opening searched issue text and the algo name, and missed an open PR\nwhose title names a different algo (`FP8_PB`). The `gh pr list --search \"<short area keywords>\"`\nstep in AGENTS.md is precisely what catches that, and running it properly is what found #50617.\nMy error.\n\nEvidence from this branch moved to #50617, since it is a real-world case for that fix rather than\nfor this one. Nothing here needs to be merged.",
